<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES FROM QUAD CITY CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES FROM QUAD CITY CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>COAL VALLEY, Illinois 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores</p>
<p>after the final round of the $1.2 million Quad City Classic at</p>
<p>Oakwood Country Club on Sunday (U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>268 Ed Fiori 66 68 67 67</p>
<p>270 Andrew Magee 69 70 69 62</p>
<p>271 Chris Perry 68 70 67 66, Steve Jones 68 68 67 68</p>
