<p>Phil Blackmar 69 71 65 67, Tiger Woods 69 64 67 72</p>
<p>274 Loren Roberts 69 70 69 66, Jeff Sluman 69 69 69 67, Brian</p>
<p>Tennyson 72 67 67 68, Mike Springer 69 72 65 68, Greg Kraft 68</p>
<p>70 67 69</p>
